<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.requests`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "mint a joining place's face-scoped keys and request the join"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.fleet.requests", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.requests"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.requests"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.fleet.requests ~ the joining place mints its keys and asks

`lares fleet join request <offer-file>` runs on the joining place with no vessel standing: its face-scoped keys mint here and stay here, and the join stands pending until its answer lands. It writes the request (`--out`) or prints it for the courier to carry back. Another pending join for the face refuses.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ request

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`request` params=`offer/offer.json out/request.json ~ request the join`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ offer · out

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`offer` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<offer-file> ~ the offer file the root holder wrote`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the file the next vessel reads; absent, print it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ runs in this process on the joining vessel, no vessel standing; its keys mint and stay here`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ offer-absent · offer-unread · join-pending · face-joinee · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`offer-absent` params=`cure/[[face.fleet.requests offer/offer.json]] ~ name the offer file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`offer-unread` params=`~ the file reads as no JSON`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`join-pending` params=`~ another join stands pending; land it or abandon it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-joinee` params=`~ the joinee names no face; the face rides the offer, and --face belongs to offer and answer`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the request refused by name (FleetJoinRefused, a store door refusal, or StoreHeld); the line names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ requested · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`requested` params=`exit/0 ~ the request, written or printed; the join stands pending`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares fleet join request

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares fleet join request]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

